window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Vampire princesses can't be tamed...unless it's by a dominant Alpha desperate to make her his mate.</p> <p>Reason Orlov, the headstrong daughter of the vampire king and black sheep of her coven, is determined to make her own path in life. </p> <p>While her father wants her married, pregnant, and out of the way, Reason isn't interested in any of it...until a sexy wolf comes in to demand her submission. </p> <p>Jack \"Jackal\" Alagona hates vampires after they took what was most precious to him, but when he meets Reason, a passion erupts between them that cannot be contained. </p> <p>Love between vampires and shifters is forbidden, but Jackal and Reason know what fate demands. </p> <p>When Reason must break the covenant in order to save Jackal's life, she puts her own in jeopardy.</p> <p>Can their love survive the tumultuous world of paranormal politics or will they be driven apart forever? </p> <p><i>Reason to Love</i> is a standalone novel in the Credence Curse Saga, a series of intercultural and interracial shifter romance tales. If you like paranormal romance novels full of strong heroines, steamy scenes, sexy shifters, and erotic thrills, then you'll fall for the latest romp from author Sedona Venez.</p> <p>Buy <i>Reason to Love</i> today to fall for this latest shifter romance tale!</p>"; 
